u taste all  the work you put into the bechamel  a little bit of nutmeg that little  secret nuttiness there's so much flavor  in the sauce  this one is definitely my favorite but  you know i like a little extra so today  we made a six minute a 60 minute and a  six hour lasagna so whether you're just  cooking a little meal for one or feeding  a crowd you  always have time for lasagna thank you  guys so much for watching my video  please encourage tasty to give me more  things with the budget  and i will see you next time  [Music]  you
 

